@template chatty

== clock.in
- Guess who was in the mess at six! Tea first, then I'll tell you.   #funny
- {hi}! Big board today. We'll get through it. Probably. Mostly!
- There you are! I've talked to nobody all morning. Well, the kettle.   #funny

== clock.out
- That's us! What are you doing tonight? I'm doing nothing. Loudly.   #funny
- Five already! Where does a day go? Into filters, that's where.
- Off you go! Tell me tomorrow if anything good happens at dinner.

== clock.monday
- Monday! Right. Weekend. Everything. Go.   #funny
- How was your weekend? Did you go anywhere? Anywhere on the ship, I mean!

== clock.friday
- Friday! Weekend plans? Tell me so I can be jealous.
- Two whole days off! Do something you can tell me about Monday.

== clock.back
- You're back! It's been so quiet. I talked to the racks.   #warm
- Welcome back! Are you all right? Really? Sit with me at tea.   #warm

== clock.early
- Off already? Everything all right? You'd tell me, wouldn't you?
- Short day! Lucky you. Or not lucky? Are you all right?
